## Telescope

[Laravel Telescope](https://laravel.com/docs/telescope) is available in the dev stack at `http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/telescope`. It is a `require-dev` package, so the staging/production image (`composer install --no-dev`) does not contain it. `App\Providers\TelescopeServiceProvider` is therefore not listed in `bootstrap/providers.php`; `AppServiceProvider::register()` registers it only when Telescope's base class exists, so staging and production boot without it.
{%- endif %}
